        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This lawyer accepted my case and all my money just to tell me at the end that he’s going to refer me to an other lawyer who will do English court proceedings just for that lawyer to scam me as well do not waste ur time and money if you want your case in court in English because after taking your money then he will tell you this news smh I will be reporting this to the barreau Quebec",
